# 50 — Search Queries

> Common search patterns for AI agents and developers working on **{{project.name}}**.

## Finding Code by Layer

| What you want | Search pattern |
|---------------|----------------|
| All entities | `class * : AggregateRoot` or `class * : Entity` |
| All value objects | `class * : ValueObject` |
| All domain events | `implements IDomainEvent` or `: IDomainEvent` |
| All commands | `IRequest<` in `Commands/` folder |
| All queries | `IRequest<` in `Queries/` folder |
| All command handlers | `IRequestHandler<` in `Commands/` folder |
| All query handlers | `IRequestHandler<` in `Queries/` folder |
| All ViewModels | `class * : ViewModelBase` or `class * : ObservableObject` |
| All WPF Views | `*.xaml` in `Presentation/Views/` |
| All repository interfaces | `interface I*Repository` in `Domain/` |
| All repository implementations | `class * : I*Repository` in `Infrastructure/` |

## Finding Code by Context

Replace `<Context>` with your bounded context name:

| What you want | Search pattern |
|---------------|----------------|
| Context domain entity | `src/{{project.dotnet.namespace}}.Domain/Entities/<Context>.cs` |
| Context commands | `src/{{project.dotnet.namespace}}.Application/Commands/<Context>/` |
| Context queries | `src/{{project.dotnet.namespace}}.Application/Queries/<Context>/` |
| Context view | `src/{{project.dotnet.namespace}}.Presentation/Views/<Context>/` |
| Context viewmodel | `src/{{project.dotnet.namespace}}.Presentation/ViewModels/<Context>/` |
| Context spec | `openspec/specs/domain/<Context>.md` |

## Architecture Compliance Checks

| Check | Search pattern |
|-------|----------------|
| Domain referencing external packages | Look for non-Common `using` in `{{project.dotnet.namespace}}.Domain/` |
| ViewModel referencing Infrastructure | `using {{project.dotnet.namespace}}.Infrastructure` in `ViewModels/` |
| Business logic in code-behind | Any logic beyond `DataContext = viewModel` in `*.xaml.cs` |
| Direct DbContext usage in Application | `DbContext` references in `Application/` |

## Finding Tests

| What you want | Search pattern |
|---------------|----------------|
| All unit tests | `tests/{{project.dotnet.namespace}}.UnitTests/**/*.cs` |
| All integration tests | `tests/{{project.dotnet.namespace}}.IntegrationTests/**/*.cs` |
| Tests for a context | `*<Context>*Tests.cs` |

